{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act18side_level_act18side_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act18side",
  "stageId": "act18side_02",
  "title": "热情，或悲怆",
  "storyCode": "LE-2",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0a48721a1dca1dca43e04bbce2e4b954cc6dcc6f44cc72c4fd21119a621af8d2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "虽然车尔尼先生那里不怎么顺利，但夕照区的其他居民都挺好说话的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "走访了十多家，还采到了几份血样，成果还算不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "天已经快黑了啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "姑娘，我看你这一整天都没闲着，在周围到处跑，也该饿了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "尝尝夕照区特产怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "特产？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "瞧瞧，油煎酸渍卷心菜，这香气，这色泽！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "（高温油煎的腌渍食品，这和健康完全背道而驰啊......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "怎么，怕我宰客？来，这一份是送你的，不要钱！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "别不好意思，你在我们这儿走街串巷替大家看病，这是感谢你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "（唉，盛情难却......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "那就多谢您了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "客气！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "怎么吃了一口就放下了，说了是送你的嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我还不饿，一会儿再吃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "不过，您有没有考虑过稍微调整一下配方？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "调整配方？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "您看，这一份餐食大约是一个成年人一餐的量，但其中含有的盐和油至少是推荐摄入量的三倍和五倍，这对健康可有害无利啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "姑娘，这道菜我可做了几十年了，来吃的人就没有不说好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "突然改了配方，我那些老主顾可是要骂人的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "这也是为了大家的健康着想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "来这里消费的，包括我自己在内，都是感染者，这种高油高盐的饮食对感染者的伤害只会比对健康人更大......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "我就问你一件事，我做的这道菜到底好不好吃？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "......非常美味。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "这不就结了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "可我还是觉得——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "好啦好啦，知道你无福消受我的手艺了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "对了，我问您一些问题，可以吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "反正现在又没生意上门，你问就是了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "您最近生意怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "忙得很！可能是因为天气暖和，这几天来吃饭的人越来越多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "来吃饭的人您都认识吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "认识啊。来照顾我生意的都是夕照区的人，我基本上都认识。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "大家都是感染者？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "有没有已经一段时间不露面，但这几天又来光顾的客人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "有，好像还不少呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "能不能麻烦您告诉我，都有哪几位客人是这种情况？他们都住哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "谢谢您！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "客气！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "最后......您最近感觉怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "你说矿石病？挺正常的，不好不坏。不过最近生意好，我每天进货都特别有劲儿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "您好像不是很热衷音乐？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "嗨，我本来也不是搞艺术的，没他们那么高的追求，能养活一家子人就知足啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我的问题问完了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "感谢您的配合，祝您生意兴隆！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "多谢，多谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "不过姑娘，菜你只吃了一口，不再多吃点吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "这——刚刚不是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "开个玩笑，开个玩笑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "你们医生把健康放在第一位，我理解！不过我们厨子自然是以口味优先，当医生的多少也理解一下我们，你觉得呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "呃......我能理解，但是不能认同。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "光是理解也挺好，求同存异嘛。下次想吃的时候记得来啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "嗯，嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "我还奇怪，这姑娘怎么吃了一口就像要哭了似的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "唉，这么好的小姑娘，怎么偏偏是个萨卡兹呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咖啡店主",
      "text": "老板，来一份酸渍卷心菜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "好嘞——哟，是你啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "肉酱要双份，菜煎到微焦，没错吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咖啡店主",
      "text": "多谢啦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咖啡店主",
      "text": "刚才那小姑娘有点面生，你认识她？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小吃摊主",
      "text": "她最近一直在街上转，不认识也认识了。怎么，难道你想请她去你们那儿喝一杯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咖啡店主",
      "text": "不至于，不至于。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "咖啡店主",
      "text": "看她那副忙忙碌碌的样子，大概是在做什么正经事吧，没机会去喝咖啡的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "异常好转的病例，分布范围比我预计的还要广啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "抱歉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "没关系。我才应该道歉，只顾着欣赏这座壮丽的建筑，却打扰了您的乐思。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "......乐思？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "再见了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "再——\n见......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "（走得好快......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "（不过也是时候回头了，广场上又没有住户......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "喂，那个女的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "（好重的酒味儿......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "对，就是你，魔族佬！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "您是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "你刚刚从我家出来，不记得了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "这么说，您是施耐德先生的亲属？刚刚我登门的时候，您好像不在家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "我是他儿子！你敢抽我父亲的血！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行板",
      "text": "芙蓉，芙蓉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "行板，你来得正好，这位先生情绪实在太激动，我不知道他想表达什么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "行板？是罗德岛的行板吧！赶紧告诉你们上司，把这个魔族佬送回去，不要再让她接近夕照区了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行板",
      "text": "这......您先别激动，说说她做什么了，我也好在报告里写啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行板",
      "text": "（小声）就说你怎么这么久都不回来......你先回办事处！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "（小声）我再看看情况。这次的事件多少有些蹊跷，他说的话没准能提供一些帮助。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "她抽我父亲的血！魔族佬！抽血！你知道这意味着什么吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "呃，施耐德先生，您可能听说了一些关于血魔的传说，但我只是一个普通的萨卡兹，鲜血对我没有任何吸引力......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "谁说什么血魔了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "这位朋友，你来评评理，收集感染者的血液，这人......到底是在干什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的感染者",
      "text": "我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "对，就是你！你——说说！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路过的感染者",
      "text": "这个......我还有事，先走了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "嘁，没骨气的东西......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "老哥，你——你来说说！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "这个嘛......具体的我也不太清楚，不过，有术师用感染者的血液施术，这我是听说过的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "最近还有高塔术师偷偷抓感染者，也是为了差不多的事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "这才是公道话！这个魔族佬到处收集我们感染者的血液，怕不就是在做这种事情！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "收集感染者的血液施术......据我所知，除了所谓的“巫王残党”......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者们",
      "text": "？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "芙蓉的无心之言一出，不光是那两个感染者，连周围看热闹的人群都在一瞬间变得寂静无声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "你......竟敢这么随便地直呼那位陛下的名号......果然是......关系不浅吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "肯定是这么回事！预言里都说了，这个魔族佬肯定是想用感染者的血液施术害人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "预言？难道你说的是那位陛下的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "没错！就是那个预言！绝对不能让那个预言成真！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的感染者",
      "text": "你们说预言？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的感染者",
      "text": "这几天我也听说有个预言，可总是模模糊糊的......具体说的是什么呀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我也好奇得很，你们因为一个预言就要把我赶走，可我连这个预言是什么都不知道，怎么可能就这么走了呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "这些事可不敢大声讲，谁能保证那位陛下没留下什么法术，我们的一举一动，也许都还......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的感染者",
      "text": "噫！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的感染者",
      "text": "那、那、那......那你小声点儿告诉我，预言说的到底是什么呀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "啧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "（小声）行板，类似的谣言你最近听过吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行板",
      "text": "（小声）说实话，不是完全没印象，但我完全没往心里去......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行板",
      "text": "（小声）且不说那位陛下早就已经不在了，就算他还健在，也没必要特地为夕照区留下什么预言啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行板",
      "text": "（小声）人可越聚越多了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的感染者",
      "text": "小姑娘，你还是避一避吧，这东西宁可信其有，不可信其无......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "滚出夕照区！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "请大家不要相信这种没有真凭实据的谣言！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "谣言？！你竟敢把预言说成是谣言，你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "这位先生，你一会儿说我和巫......和那些残党关系不浅，一会儿又暗示我对他不敬，如此自相矛盾，你到底想表达什么，煽动什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "你们这种人的行事本来就不能以常理揣度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "再说，你一个魔族佬跑到夕照区来，还打着做调查的旗号收集大家的血液，谁知道你想干什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "就算你没有恶意，我们也不能放着预言不管，让你在这儿逗留，大伙说是不是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "围观的感染者们",
      "text": "是！是啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "不知道为什么，可能是因为冠上了“那位陛下”的名号吧，各位似乎很害怕这场子虚乌有的灾难。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "但我有更害怕的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我害怕我找不到这次事件的答案。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "一旦我退缩了，要么，我会错失拯救生命的良机；要么，我会因为自己的胆怯，放任你们陷入危险。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "你们视我为用感染者血液施术的残忍术师，把我当成散布灾难的“魔族佬”......我都不介意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我只想拯救更多的生命，除此以外，对夕照区别无所求。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "别扯谎了，不走，你就是故意在夕照区搞破坏！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "各位，我无意在这里和你们起什么冲突。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "如果你们实在不想见到我，我可以暂时回到罗德岛办事处，各位也冷静一下，好不好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的感染者",
      "text": "嘁，这还像句人话——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "不行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "你以为罗德岛办事处在哪儿？办事处也是夕照区的一部分！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "还是说，你觉得罗德岛有什么特权，罗德岛办事处可以不归夕照区管了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "我们绝对不答应！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可疑的感染者",
      "text": "大伙跟我上，把魔族佬赶出去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一些人冲了上去，一些人原地不动，还有一些人选择背向芙蓉，离开是非之地。\n无论他们做何选择，芙蓉只是站在那里，既不选择战斗，也不选择逃跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
